&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;社外取締役&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 100px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p class="text_align_justify" style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 12px"&gt;宮本暢子&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 94px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
